<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
        td { padding: 5px; vertical-align: top; }
        .header-title { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .sub-heading { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .instruction { font-size: 9pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .caution { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 9pt; }
        .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 10pt; }
        .form-label { flex: 1; }
        .form-input { flex: 2; }
        .checkbox-group { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
        .checkbox-group div { display: flex; align-items: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="section-heading">TLS. Have you transferred all tax files for this year?</div>
            <div class="instruction">
                <span data-field="instruction_text_1">{{ instruction_text_1 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="instruction_text_2">{{ instruction_text_2 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="instruction_text_3">{{ instruction_text_3 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="instruction_text_4">{{ instruction_text_4 }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">5</div>
            <div class="section-heading">I.R.S. SPECIFICATIONS</div>
            <div class="instruction">
                <span data-field="spec_text_1">{{ spec_text_1 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="spec_text_2">{{ spec_text_2 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="spec_text_3">{{ spec_text_3 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="spec_text_4">{{ spec_text_4 }}</span>
                <br>
                <span data-field="spec_text_5">{{ spec_text_5 }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="width: 30%;">
                <div class="section-heading">Date</div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 30%; text-align: center;">
                <div class="section-heading">Action</div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 40%; text-align: right;">
                <div class="section-heading">Signature</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
                <td style="width: 30%; text-align: center;"></td>
                <td style="width: 40%;"></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 30%;">
                <div class="section-heading">Date</div>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 70%; text-align: right;">
                <div class="instruction">Revised proofs requested</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Separation 1: Black</div>
        <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Separation 2: PMS-3005 BLUE</div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <div class="section-heading">SCHEDULE EIC (Form 1040A or 1040)</div>
            <div class="sub-heading">Qualifying Child Information</div>
            <div class="instruction">Complete and attach to Form 1040A or 1040 only if you have a qualifying child.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">OMB No. 1545-0074</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Attachment</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Tax Year: <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span></div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Your social security number</div>
            <div style="height: 40px;"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="section-heading">Before you begin:</div>
        <div class="caution">
            <span data-field="caution_text_1">{{ caution_text_1 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="instruction">
            <span data-field="instruction_text_5">{{ instruction_text_5 }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="section-heading">1 Child's name</div>
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">First name</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Last name</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">First name</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Last name</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="child_1_first_name">{{ child_1_first_name }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="child_1_last_name">{{ child_1_last_name }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="child_2_first_name">{{ child_2_first_name }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="child_2_last_name">{{ child_2_last_name }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">2 Child's SSN</div>
        <div class="instruction">
            <span data-field="instruction_text_6">{{ instruction_text_6 }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">3 Child's year of birth</div>
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Year</td>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Year</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="child_1_birth_year">{{ child_1_birth_year }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="child_2_birth_year">{{ child_2_birth_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="section-heading">4 If the child was born before 1986—</div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>a Was the child under age 24 at the end of 2004 and a student?</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>No. Go to line 5.</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>Yes. Continue</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>No. Go to line 5.</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>Yes. Continue</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">5 Child's relationship to you</div>
        <div class="instruction">
            <span data-field="instruction_text_7">{{ instruction_text_7 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
            <span data-field="child_relationship">{{ child_relationship }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">6 Number of months child lived with you in the United States during 2004</div>
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">If the child lived with you for more than half of 2004 but less than 7 months, enter "7".</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">months</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">If the child was born in 2004 and your home was the child's home for the entire time, enter "12".</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">months</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">TIP</div>
        <div class="caution">
            <span data-field="tip_text_1">{{ tip_text_1 }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Purpose of Schedule</div>
        <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Taking the EIC when not eligible. If you take the EIC even though you are not eligible and it is intentional disregard of the EIC rules, you will not be allowed to take the credit for up to 10 years even if you are otherwise eligible to do so. If you fraudulently take the EIC, you will not be allowed to take the credit for 10 years. You may also have to pay penalties.</div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <div class="section-heading">Qualifying Child</div>
            <div class="instruction">A qualifying child is a child who is your ...</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <span data-field="qualifying_child_relationship_1">{{ qualifying_child_relationship_1 }}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <span data-field="qualifying_child_relationship_2">{{ qualifying_child_relationship_2 }}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <span data-field="qualifying_child_relationship_3">{{ qualifying_child_relationship_3 }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">AND</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">was at the end of 2004 ...</div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>Under age 19</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>or</label>
            </div>
            <div>
                <input type="checkbox">
                <label>Under age 24 and a student</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">AND</div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">who ...</div>
        <div class="instruction">
            <span data-field="instruction_text_8">{{ instruction_text_8 }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="section-heading">If the child was married or meets the conditions to be a qualifying child of another person (other than your spouse if you are filing a joint return), special rules apply. For details, see page 42 of the Form 1040A instructions or page 44 of the Form 1040 instructions.</div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>